{"id":"vod_sn_36673","vodId":"36673","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"春原庄的管理人","name_cn":"春原庄的管理人","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/170f291123cd3b8cbd50bb42455b8fb2.jpg"},"summary":"椎名亚树（喜多村英梨 配音）因为外表的缘故，常常被人误认为是女孩子，这让他非常的苦恼，十分希望增加一些男子气概。为了培养自己独立生活的能力，升入初中后亚树独自前往东京，住进了春原庄，开始了一个人的生活。　　成熟稳重温柔贤惠的春原庄主人春原彩花（佐藤利奈 配音）、活泼开朗有时有些活泼过头的春原菜菜（佐仓绫音 配音）、拥有超高人气的学生会会长雪本柚子（高森奈津美 配音）、虽然看上去十分冷漠但实际上对可爱的东西完全没辙的月见里堇（濑户麻沙美 配音）、整天笑嘻嘻但内心里的想法无人知晓的风见百合（宫本侑芽 配音），在这些姐姐们的陪伴下，亚树真的能够成长吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8BCkHcCixw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r3Xe8xu4961/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NTRMRDMtV51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SK66q3NBiK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZCaGRXCgH91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pM2cWfA80X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NVwa9McL9i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qEhvMA1LQP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ysg8je3gy21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R7LQf1093M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AWR5fKeFvh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/76i6NXZsrn1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.872Z"}